@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:To start the process;
:Course Packet Information Received should be sent;
:sending the Design to Faculty;
repeat :;
:the Faculty will choose the design;
:identify the content that requires copyright clearance and contact the publisher to obtain clearance;
:v1: condition  if need to Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:If there is a need to "Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added;
repeat while () is ([v1 = "Yes"]) not ([v1 = "No"])
:Calculate the Course Packet Cost;
:add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price;
:v2: condition  if Price of the Course Packet is finalized ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = "Yes"])
:notify the Bookstore of the Course packet, Course number, Faculty name, and sections;
:the Packet information should be notified to the Bookstore;
stop
else ([v2 = "No"])
:If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price;
endif
@enduml